From: Jose Luis Blanco-Claraco <joseluisblancoc@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 18:19:17 +0200
Subject: Disable -Werror by default and enable it explicitly in CI

Warnings-as-errors is a useful gate for GTSAM's own CI, but in downstream
builds (distribution packages, user builds) new compilers, hardening/LTO
flags or system libraries can emit harmless warnings that break the build.
Make GTSAM_BUILD_WITH_WERROR default to OFF, and pass
-DGTSAM_BUILD_WITH_WERROR=ON to every CMake configure step in the GitHub
workflows and CI scripts.
